I have something to confess.

462
00:32:17,520 --> 00:32:21,420
We all understand that it will be too late to do anything.

463
00:32:21,420 --> 00:32:25,540
You cannot at that moment when you finally go before the judge say, oh, I've been meaning to tell you.

464
00:32:25,540 --> 00:32:26,360
Right?

465
00:32:26,360 --> 00:32:30,320
Suggesting that maybe the two of you work this out.

466
00:32:30,840 --> 00:32:38,380
So David says, therefore, let the godly pray at a time when they're, pray to you, God, when there's still time, that they may not be drowned in the floodwaters of judgment.

467
00:32:38,380 --> 00:32:40,820
We literally, until then, have nothing but time.

468
00:32:40,820 --> 00:32:41,860
That's what we have is time.

469
00:32:41,860 --> 00:32:42,340
Right?

470
