And at that time, judgment, it will be suddenly and crystal clear that nothing else matters quite as much as restoration of the relationship with God.

471
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:59,160
Humble confession of sin, turning to live within the protected hiding place of his unfailing love that surrounds those who trust the Lord.

