476
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:21,400
Verse 7, to protect you from trouble and surround you with those songs of deliverance.

477
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:23,520
This is David's message.

478
00:33:23,520 --> 00:33:29,500
When you sing this to God or say it to God, I actually, I write things when I'm praying the Psalms out.

